<title>USA: Washington National sets special meeting.</title>
<headline>Washington National sets special meeting.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington National Corp said it will hold a special stockholders meeting on March 21 to vote on its proposed merger with PennCorp Financial Group Inc.</p>
<p>The close of business on February 4 was set as the record date for determination of shareholders entitled to notice of and vote at the special meeting.</p>
<p>Both are insurance companies.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
